window.EN={"1":"Having been reunited with the members of the Fiana Freeblades as well,","2":"Leif,","3":"guided by the knight Carrion,","4":"whom Hannibal had assigned as an escort, headed west.","5":"And then he comes to the foot of Purple Dragon Mountain, the base of Dagdar and the other former Purple Dragon Mountain bandits...","6":"This area is Purple Dragon Mountain.","7":"Thank you. We'll be all right on our own from here.","8":"Please return to General Hannibal.","9":"I will not be going back to Thracia. General Hannibal has agreed to it.","10":"What?","11":"The general knows everything. No, not only the general.","12":"Rumors that Prince Leif is alive have already spread throughout the peninsula.","13":"The people are hoping that you, Prince, will unite the anti-imperial forces and rise up.","14":"Naturally I, too, consider it an honor to be able to take part in the battle to liberate my homeland.","15":"Homeland? Weren't you Thracian?","16":"No. I was born into a family of Leonster knights.","17":"My father died in the last war, but my mother and I were saved by the general.","18":"Prince Leif, please add me to your retainers.","19":"I want you to let me take part too in the battle to take back Leonster!","20":"...I'm sorry, but I don't have that kind of power right now.","21":"Take back Leonster... can such a thing really be done...?","22":"In that case, it will be all right. In any event, let us go to Lord Hannibal's mountain villa.","23":"The general's villa?","24":"Yes. There are many others like me there.","25":"Under General Hannibal's protection, Count Dorias is training young knights.","26":"What!? Dorias... Did you say Count Dorias!?","27":"...Really... Dorias is alive...","28":"Will you come?","29":"Of course!","30":"To be able to meet Count Dorias again... it's as if I'm dreaming.","31":"Prince Leif, forgive me for interrupting, but bandits have appeared.","32":"It seems a village is being attacked. What will you do?","33":"You hardly need to ask. We'll help the villagers. Carrion, you'll lend a hand, won't you?","34":"Of course, Lord Leif. But it's strange.","35":"This area is the territory of a former bandit called Dagdar, yet his village is being attacked...","36":"Hey, hand over the money like you promised. I'm in trouble if I don't get back to the army soon.","37":"Sorry, but could you work just a little longer?","38":"Some weird people have come to the village. Just for a little while, I want you to stand watch over this mansion.","39":"I've got a little job to take care of.","40":"Tch, side jobs aren't easy either. Well, fine. I'll finish up quick and pull out.","41":"Honestly, what are Gomez's men dawdling for?","42":"Hmm, I've no choice but to go out myself. I didn't want to do anything that stands out, but...","43":"While Dagdar was off in Fiana village, his underling Gomez went back to being a bandit.","44":"He's an idiot, but he sure is strong.","45":"What, you folks will take care of Gomez for us?","46":"That's a real help. We don't want this village we worked so hard to clear ruined.","47":"It's not much by way of thanks, but I'll give you folks this crest.","48":"Hey, you came at a good time. I, the luckiest man in the world, will give you a present.","49":"Here, nice bracelet, huh?","50":"That merchant was spouting off that I'd find happiness if I used this...","51":"I've had it, and I'm not the least bit happier! Damn it... I got swindled...","52":"Sneak, sneak, sneak...","53":"Huh? Aren't you Marty!?","54":"Gulp. N-no, you've got the wrong person...","55":"Look, just turning your back doesn't stop anyone from recognizing you.","56":"More importantly, what are you doing in a place like this!","57":"No... well... Gomez, he...","58":"That's not what I'm asking!","59":"If you're going to ignore how Lady Eyvel and Dagdar feel, then from today you're an enemy! Get ready!","60":"W-wait! ...Sorry. I was wrong...","61":"...Then you'll fight with us, right?","62":"...But, you know, Gomez...","63":"Graaah! You're so annoying!","64":"Make it clear! Marty, are you an enemy, or a friend!?","65":"O-okay, okay. I'll fight with you guys! So don't get so mad...","66":"Sneak, sneak, sneak...","67":"Huh? Marty...","68":"Gulp. N-no, you've got the wrong person...","69":"...Just turning your back doesn't stop anyone from recognizing you.","70":"More importantly, what is the meaning of this?","71":"No... well... Gomez, he...","72":"Don't give me \"no, well\"! I'm disappointed...","73":"I-it couldn't be helped. I mean...","74":"...Anyway, make it clear here and now.","75":"Will you betray Lady Eyvel's and Dagdar's feelings and side with the enemy?","76":"O-okay... Don't lay into me like that...","77":"Then you'll take our side?","78":"......","79":"Marty!","80":"O-of course I will. Yeah...","81":"That's done for now, I suppose...","82":"It seems the other bandits have mostly been dealt with as well.","83":"So with Dagdar gone, there was nothing to hold them back...","84":"There is an old proverb: \"A thousand pegasi led by a single dragon","85":"are stronger than a thousand dragons led by a single pegasus.\"","86":"It speaks to how important the one who stands at the top is.","87":"...I must take that to heart too.","88":"Prince Leif, I have brought the leader of the bandits.","89":"Good, I'll see him. Bring him in.","90":"So you are the bandits' leader...","91":"But that uniform looks to me like the Thracian army's...","92":"Hmph. That has nothing to do with you. Why don't you hurry up and kill me?","93":"No, I have no intention of killing you. If you answer just one question, I'll release you.","94":"Release... me?","95":"Don't joke with me! To accept an enemy's pity would shame the name of dragon knight.","96":"But don't you have a wife, and children too?","97":"If you die, they will be left destitute. Are you all right with that?","98":"......","99":"You must have your own circumstances.","100":"I won't pry any further into who you are. And of course I won't pursue you after you go.","101":"...What... is the question?","102":"The whereabouts of Dagdar, the master of this mansion, and his daughter Tanya.","103":"......","104":"They're... inside the mansion... Gomez... should be... on his way to kill them now...","105":"Understood. Thank you.","106":"August, release him, dragon and all.","107":"...Yes...","108":"...I'm sorry...","109":"Dagdar, you're safe.","110":"Oh, Prince, you came all this way? Sorry about that. Is Eyvel with you too?","111":"......","112":"What's wrong, Prince?","113":"...Eyvel is... in Munster. We couldn't rescue her with our strength...","114":"What!? What on earth were you people doing!","115":"There was nothing we could do! With my strength... nothing...","116":"......","117":"If I... had been even a little stronger... If I... had even a little more power...","118":"...Prince, that's enough. Don't blame yourself so much.","119":"But...","120":"Sorry. I ended up shouting. It was just so unexpected.","121":"But when I think about it, you're not that soft a man, Prince. I said a bad thing.","122":"Dagdar...","123":"Hey, no need to worry. From now on I'll help you, Prince.","124":"I may be no match for Eyvel, but I won't lose to the young pups around here yet.","125":"And then, let's go together and take Eyvel back!","126":"Lord Leif...","127":"Tanya... Thank goodness. You're safe.","128":"Yes...","129":"When Gomez learned that my father had died, he let me go.","130":"He said he'd done wrong by everyone in the village, and to apologize for him...","131":"I see... Tanya, I'm sorry about Dagdar...","132":"It's all right. Father did the right thing...","133":"What will you do now, Tanya? If you like, won't you come with us?","134":"Is it really all right for someone like me to go with you?","135":"Of course. I want you to come, Tanya.","136":"Y-yes! Of course I'll go with you! Thank you for having me!","137":"Sorry. This is for the money, too. Don't think badly of me.","138":"Eline, Mahal, Min... I'm sorry... Daddy can't come home...","139":"Sorry. I owe you. I've had enough of this sort of thing.","140":"I'll work honestly for my kids' sake...","141":"Somehow, this has turned into a real mess...","142":"Why does it turn out like this...","143":"I-I'm sorry. It couldn't be helped.","144":"I wanted to fight alongside you people from the start.","145":"Forgive me..."};
